# - docker exec (direct container access)
# - docker run (creating new containers)
# - Any commands with wildcards (*) or regex patterns
# - Access to deployment files or .env files
# - File operations outside of /var/www/checkitout.app/

# =============================================================================
# END OF CONFIGURATION
